docs {
  # Get Static Content
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/capaian/static-content`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil konten statis",
    "data": {
      "banner": {
        "title": "Capaian PRPM",
        "subtitle": "Prestasi dan Pencapaian",
        "image_url": "/uploads/banner/capaian.jpg"
      },
      "tentang": {
        "title": "Tentang PRPM",
        "content": "Deskripsi tentang PRPM..."
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
